  "identifier": "fiji",
  "name": "Fiji",
  "alternateName": [
    "Fiji Is Just ImageJ"
  ],
  "description": "The standard batteries-included distribution of ImageJ for life sciences research. Bundles ImageJ with 200+ curated plugins covering segmentation, registration, tracking, deconvolution, and morphological analysis — pre-configured and ready to use without manual plugin installation. Includes Bio-Formats for reading 150+ proprietary microscopy formats, TrackMate for cell tracking, BigDataViewer for large volume rendering, and MorphoLibJ for morphological operations. Extends ImageJ with a rolling-release update site system that keeps plugins current. The de facto bioimage analysis platform across cell biology, neuroscience, and pathology — cited in hundreds of thousands of scientific papers. GPL-3.0 (individual plugins may be GPL-2+), 971 stars. Maintained by Curtis Rueden at LOCI, University of Wisconsin-Madison, with broad community contribution.",
