  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The most widely used bioimage analysis platform in life sciences — cited in hundreds of thousands of papers across cell biology, neuroscience, and pathology. Ships 200+ plugins pre-integrated including Bio-Formats (150+ format support), TrackMate, and BigDataViewer. Rolling update sites keep it current. GPL-3.0 applies to the distribution; individual plugins vary. Adopt as the standard general-purpose bioimage analysis environment and the entry point for researchers before moving to specialised pathology tools such as QuPath or TIA Toolbox.",
